<DocLayout
  title="Privacy, Pretty Good Video Coaching"
  description="Pretty Good Video Coaching does not collect, transmit, or share any of your data. Everything the app creates stays on your device."
>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="doc-updated">Last updated September 1, 2026</p>

  <p>
    Pretty Good Video Coaching does not collect, transmit, or share any of your
    data. Everything the app creates stays on your device.
  </p>

  <h2>What the app stores</h2>
  <p>The app saves the following <strong>only on your device</strong>, inside its own private storage:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Videos you record in the app or import from your photo library or files</li>
    <li>Drawings and angle/range-of-motion measurements you add to those videos</li>
    <li>Voice notes and narration you record</li>
    <li>Titles, client names, and any notes you type</li>
    <li>Thumbnail images generated from your videos</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What the app sends</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing. The app has no accounts, no sign-in, no servers, and no network
    features. Your videos and notes are never uploaded anywhere by this app.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics and tracking</h2>
  <p>
    The app contains no analytics, no advertising, no tracking, and no
    third-party SDKs. Nothing about your usage is measured or reported.
  </p>

  <h2>Device permissions</h2>
  <p>
    The app asks for these permissions only to provide its core features, and
    uses them entirely on-device:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Camera</strong>, to record video clips for review</li>
    <li><strong>Microphone</strong>, to record audio with clips and to record voice notes</li>
    <li><strong>Photo Library</strong>, to import videos you choose</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    If you use the app's export and share features, you choose where the
    exported video or report goes (for example Messages, Mail, or Files). At
    that point the file is handled by whatever app or service you selected,
    under its own privacy policy. The app itself does not send it anywhere.
  </p>

  <h2>Data retention and deletion</h2>
  <p>
    Your data lives on your device. Deleting a clip in the app deletes its
    video, drawings, and voice notes. Deleting the app removes all of its data.
  </p>
  <p>
    Because the app stores its data in its own folder on your device, that data
    may be included in your device's normal iCloud or computer backups if you
    have backups enabled. Those backups are controlled by Apple and your device
    settings, not by this app.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    The app is not directed at children and does not knowingly collect any
    information from anyone.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted at this same
    address with a new "last updated" date.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy:
    <a href="mailto:tom@prettygoodsoftware.llc">tom@prettygoodsoftware.llc</a>
  </p>
</DocLayout>
